ok - record: a primary in a Herdr pane records its pane, harness, launch flags, and native session
ok - launch-line: recorded flags replayed, session selector dropped, recorded session resumed only when on disk
ok - launch-line: a primary that recovery relaunched is relaunched again without its earlier prompt
ok - record: a second mate home keeps no primary endpoint record
ok - run: nothing happens without a recorded baseline and a detected restart
ok - run: an unreachable Herdr ends the pass within its bound, with one wake
