ok - run: a restart loop stops after the rate limit with one alert
ok - run: a primary the captain started by hand, by its home or by the fleet lock, is not launched twice
ok - run: a primary started by hand while the pass runs is seen right before the launch, and nothing is typed
ok - run: a Claude process older than the Herdr server is not read as a manual relaunch
